# Bare Read/Write(Buf, N) on a TStream-family receiver discards the byte count (16, 17, 19)
# Result used (20, 21), ReadBuffer/WriteBuffer (22, 23: they raise) and 1-arg Read (24) must not fire
# Known FP shape: a receiver that is a field/global has no visible declaration -> silent
stream-read-result-ignored 16
stream-read-result-ignored 17
stream-read-result-ignored 19
!stream-read-result-ignored 20
!stream-read-result-ignored 21
!stream-read-result-ignored 22
!stream-read-result-ignored 23
!stream-read-result-ignored 24
